    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 154 of the laws of 1921, relating to the port\nauthority of New York and New Jersey, in relation to information concerning\nservices for human trafficking victims in Port Authority bus terminals",
    "basePrintNo": "S8573",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8573-2021",
